-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Bundled third-party software
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Docker image produced from this repository bundles additional software
components that retain their upstream licenses:

  * ISIS3 (USGS Astrogeology Science Center) — Public Domain
      https://github.com/DOI-USGS/ISIS3/blob/dev/LICENSE.md

  * Ames Stereo Pipeline (NASA Ames / NeoGeographyToolkit) — Apache License 2.0
      https://github.com/NeoGeographyToolkit/StereoPipeline/blob/master/LICENSE

  * Miniconda (Anaconda, Inc.) — BSD 3-Clause
      https://docs.conda.io/projects/miniconda/en/latest/miniconda-license.html

The "Lunar Studio additions" to ISIS3 (the KPLO LUTI camera model and the
modifications to the `campt` and `CameraPointInfo` sources) live in the
separate ISIS3 fork at https://github.com/Suwan00/lunar_studio and are
released under the ISIS3 upstream Public Domain dedication.
